WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.889
SIMU LIU
Hello everyone, we're from the cast of

00:00:01.939 --> 00:00:04.092
Marvel Studios' Shang-Chi
and the Legend of the Ten Rings,

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:06.263
and today we're going to play
a game that'll hopefully let you know

00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:08.516
a little bit more
about our characters.

00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:11.380
KATY
You got this. Don't be nervous.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.221
SHANG-CHI
Thank you.

00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:16.143
MENG'ER ZHANG
Me.

00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:18.075
SIMU LIU
[Laughing] That was fast!

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:18.870
AWKWAFINA
Yes.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:19.346
MENG'ER ZHANG
Right?

00:00:19.396 --> 00:00:21.370
SIMU LIU
Yes... Like, your character or you?

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.733
I just want to make sure
that you know, also you!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.096
KATY
You're, like, such a badass.

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:30.031
Everything that you do
is, like, so cool.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:34.951
AWKWAFINA
You.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:35.755
SIMU LIU
You think it's me?

00:00:35.805 --> 00:00:37.469
AWKWAFINA
Shang would make a snarky...

00:00:37.844 --> 00:00:39.782
like, a "well, let's go, big boy!"

00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.349
MENG'ER ZHANG
[Laughing]

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:42.177
SIMU
Shang is known to say that.

00:00:42.227 --> 00:00:43.583
AWKWAFINA
I'm ready to rumble, big boy...

00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:46.669
What, I don't know what
men say, "why so big, big boy?"

00:00:46.719 --> 00:00:48.000
[Laughing]

00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:53.387
AWKWAFINA
Both of you guys.

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:58.267
You have superhero
genetics, are you kidding me?

00:00:58.318 --> 00:01:00.331
SIMU LIU
Here's the thing, how many times can you

00:01:00.381 --> 00:01:04.599
punch a zombie without,
like, without getting bit?

00:01:04.649 --> 00:01:06.242
KATY
Oh. Right.

00:01:10.165 --> 00:01:12.841
AWKWAFINA
Definitely me, and that was one time!

00:01:12.891 --> 00:01:14.735
And it was just my Social!

00:01:16.797 --> 00:01:18.454
No, really. Couple times.

00:01:23.685 --> 00:01:24.690
MENG'ER ZHANG
Not me.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.526
SIMU LIU
I don't know, I've never done that

00:01:25.576 --> 00:01:26.503
character work before.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:32.009
I got to really reach down and go like,
what does my character want for coffee?

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:37.758
SIMU LIU
Trick question! All of us, it's all of us.

00:01:37.808 --> 00:01:40.351
We save the world together
because we're a super team.

